    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A single derivation step recorded in the column lineage graph.</para>
<para>Each entry describes how one target column was produced from a set of source columns, along with the transformation applied and optional expression detail. Entries are append-only: once recorded they are never modified or deleted. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
